OL,3,GNEWSAMP concerned by possible migrant
OL,4,Asite cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP says he is "deeply concerned" by
OL,7,Freports of job losses, pay cuts and
OL,8,Fchanges to working conditions affecting
OL,9,Fstaff at sites used to process migrants
OL,10,Farriving by small boat.
OL,12,FAn image seen by the BBC showed there
OL,13,Fwas a proposal to cut 290 jobs across
OL,14,Fthe Manston processing centre and
OL,15,FWestern Jet Foil in Dover.
OL,17,FDover MP Mike Tapp said: "These workers
OL,18,Fcarry out an incredibly demanding and
OL,19,Fsensitive job on the frontline of our
OL,20,Fborder. They deserve respect, fair
OL,21,Ftreatment and job security."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
