OL,3,GNEWSAMP concerned by possible migrant
OL,4,Asite cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FMTC Definitive (MTCD), which manages
OL,7,Fthe sites, says no final decision has
OL,8,Fbeen made regarding future staffing
OL,9,Flevels or the impact on roles, and
OL,10,Fproposed changes will be subject to
OL,11,Fconsultation.
